<title>USA: Electropharmacology fights shrs delisting.</title>
<headline>Electropharmacology fights shrs delisting.</headline>
<dateline>POMPANO BEACH, Fla. 1997-07-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Electropharmacology Inc said Friday it requested a review of Nasdaq's planned delisting of its stock.</p>
<p>The company said its stock will remain listed on Nasdaq's small cap market pending the outcome of the review, which will be &quot;in due course.&quot;</p>
<p>The company said July 18 Nasdaq would delist its stock July 24 because the company no longer complied with the market's minimum capital and surplus requirements.</p>
<p>The company's shares traded at 1/2 Friday early afternoon, up 1/16 but close to their 52-week low of 3/8.</p>
